<title>AUSTRIA: VA Stahl 3-mth net 643 mln ats, 3 ats div.</title>
<headline>VA Stahl 3-mth net 643 mln ats, 3 ats div.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the short financial year January to March 1997. Last year VA Stahl announced it was shifting its financial year to end on March 31.</p>
<p>			 (in million schillings unless stated)</p>
<p>				  Jan-Mar 1997	    Full-yr 1996</p>
<p> Net profit			 643			1,688</p>
<p> Pre-tax			    741			2,031</p>
<p> Dividend (schillings)	    3			   12</p>
<p> Operating (earnings before   376			1,695</p>
<p>interest and tax)</p>
<p> Operating result before	902			3,551</p>
<p>depreciation</p>
<p> Turnover			 7,908		     31,519</p>
<p> Investments			773			4,530</p>
<p> Employees		     14,687		     14,795</p>
<p>NOTE - Steelmaker VA Stahl said in a statement it expected its 1997/8 results to be at least as good as 1996 and forecast a price increase of around five percent in quarterly contracts between the second and third quarters.</p>
<p>&quot;Should all the major investments become operational without teething troubles a slight additional improvement in results might be possible,&quot; the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
